WEBVTT

00:00:27.854 --> 00:00:30.220
who would be meeting with some local

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:31.723
village elders.

00:00:31.723 --> 00:00:33.990
The column came under ambush,

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:36.497
and was surrounded on three sides,

00:00:36.497 --> 00:00:39.437
and amongst many other things,

00:00:39.437 --> 00:00:40.843
Captain Swenson was recognized

00:00:40.843 --> 00:00:43.060
for running into live fire

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.241
to rescue the wounded

00:00:44.241 --> 00:00:48.464
and pull out the dead.

00:00:48.464 --> 00:00:51.320
One of the people he rescued was a sergeant,

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.758
and he and a comrade were making their way

00:00:53.758 --> 00:00:56.048
to a medevac helicopter.

00:00:56.048 --> 00:00:58.236
And what was remarkable about this day

00:00:58.236 --> 00:01:00.227
is, by sheer coincidence,